# Optional overrides for Launch-WoW-Storage.sh
# Copy to /usr/local/etc/wow-forever-storage.env only if you need non-default paths.
#
# === Configure in DroidDeck / Steam (required) ===
#
# WoW shortcut (Linux target — do not put stamper-wrap in Exe; Steam mangles %command%):
#   Exe:  /usr/local/bin/Launch-WoW.sh
#   Launch options:  -d3d11
# Launch-WoW.sh runs stamper-wrap → Launch-WoW-Storage.sh; set WOW_NO_STAMPER=1 here.
#   Compatibility:  DroidDeck-Proton with WoW ARM64EC / tier-8 fixes
# Session: Linux Vulkan driver (Turnip, etc.)
#
# Battle.net → Play (separate from the WoW shortcut)
#   Battle.net must pass -d3d11 when it starts WowB, or DXVK/WoW may use the wrong API.
#   In Battle.net: select WoW / Forever → gear → Game Settings →
#   "Additional command line arguments" (wording may vary):  -d3d11
#   Do not put d3d11 or dxgi in WINEDLLOVERRIDES.
#
# Steam supplies on Play: SteamAppId, STEAM_COMPAT_DATA_PATH, STEAM_COMPAT_TOOL_PATHS, ICD vars.
#
# === Typical env overrides ===
#
# Game files outside the Proton prefix:
# WOW_ROOT=/root/Storage/Game
#
# Forever beta realm list:
# WOW_PORTAL=test
#
# === Manual launch without Steam (adb / shell) ===
# WOW_APPID=2980947332
# WOW_PREFIX=/root/.local/share/Steam/steamapps/compatdata/2980947332
# WOW_PROTON_DIR="/path/to/DroidDeck-Proton …"
# WOW_GAME_ARGS=-d3d11
#
# WOW_LOGDIR=/tmp/wow-launch-storage
# WOW_STAMPER=/usr/local/bin/droiddeck-steamgame-stamp.sh
# WOW_NO_STAMPER=1
